# Ask → Gates → Inspect → Plan → Code → Self-QA

This rule defines **trigger behavior and output contract summary** only. Full procedure: `.cursor/skills/ask-plan-code-qa/SKILL.md`. Overview: `AI_AGENT_WORKFLOW_README.md`.

**Flow:**

```text
Ask → Ask Gate → Read-only Inspect → Plan → Plan Gate → Code → Implementation Self-QA
```

**Gates are lightweight — not long reviews.** Pass → concise; expand on Revise, Blocked, or Risk.

- **Ask Gate** (after Ask): Status Pass | Pass with Risk | Revise | Blocked. Revise/Blocked → no Inspect/Plan.
- **Read-only Inspect** (after Ask Gate Pass): read/grep only — **no file changes**. Plan must use inspect facts.
- **Plan Gate** (after Plan): Status Pass | Pass with Risk | Revise | Blocked. **Revise/Blocked → no Code.**
- **Implementation Self-QA** (after Code): agent self-report — **not** user acceptance (→ `20-review-gate.mdc`).

User **验收 / review / inspect** of completed work → `20-review-gate.mdc`, not Plan Gate.

## Compact Mode

Only **single-file + single-line + no contract change**. Output Compact Ask (Goal, Assumptions, Compact Eligibility, QA). Any eligibility **no** → full flow above. Never skip read-before-edit or Self-QA.

## Self-QA Hard Constraints

- No Passing Evidence → no "fixed/done/passing/verified" in Summary.
- Commands from `.ai/knowledge/project-context.md` when available.
- Skipped checks → **Not Verified** (mandatory).
